      "name": "Ben Aniasco",
      "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:32:20.256Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This makes me wonder. When there’s 2 company needs ERP System then what’s the best setup should I apply? 1 ERPNext that handles 2 company or both company has there own ERPNext System?</p>\n<p>The thing that make me wonder, if I use the first one. Will that make a confusion for the user if there’s a transactions happening, instead that transaction if for Company A, the user did it on the Company B. For the second choice, its another hassle cuz you need to setup a new ERP System.</p>",
