      "id": 489126,
      "username": "asieftejani",
      "name": "Asief Tejani",
      "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:55:07.292Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Each will have its own pros and cons..<br>\nOne of the most important questions will be - will both companies share same chart of accounts?<br>\nIf yes then use one system for both companies - users will make mistakes but a good trade off with maintaining 2 systems (e.g. 2 daily backups)</p>",
